      "first_response": "She accepts Vanir's explanation with relief. Nera's hesitation looks like the obstacle between him and the impressive demonstration she wants everyone to see; she is too ready to treat that hesitation as something encouragement can overcome.\n\n\"Lord Vanir is going to teach you himself! I would be delighted to have that chance. Please, won't you try? I want everyone to see how splendidly he can explain it.\"\n\nShe turns toward Nera, leaning forward with an eager, expectant smile. She does not take the clerk's hand or begin the trick for her, but the watching expression adds pressure rather than giving Nera an easy refusal.\n",
