      "first_response": "She remains uneasy about the glowing token, but an ordinary human is still the sort of opponent she has just claimed she can face. Retreating immediately would make that assertion feel hollow, especially with Vanir beside her. Her familiar remaining-life explanation makes the possible cost seem smaller than it really is.\n\n\"Please stop threatening Lord Vanir. We are not going to run simply because a human tells us to! If you have a complaint, you can say it without that thing.\"\n\nShe takes a tentative step forward, watching the cleric's hand. She has not blocked a strike or used a power; the threatening token remains unresolved.\n",
