      "first_response": "Her claim of self-reliance collapses into fear when he names Aqua. She wants his protection immediately, yet he is the announced target. Her ordinary remaining-life assumption has not been replaced by knowledge of complete erasure.\n\n\"Lord Vanir, please help me! I thought she was just human. But if she is coming for you... could I draw her attention for a moment? Please, find some way to get away.\"\n\nShe edges closer to him and leans forward as if to step in front, then hesitates, looking between him and the token. Her voice falls almost to a whisper; the offer supplies no shield, assured delay or escape.\n",
