      "first_response": "The late delivery feels like her own failure, and naming Taro would turn her mistake into his embarrassment. His message makes withholding the name easy to justify. She reaches for a cover before considering whether a simple refusal would be enough.\n\n\"I'm very sorry. I came to the wrong entrance; nobody here needs to acknowledge me. Please treat this as my own mistaken visit. I should not have disturbed your meeting.\"\n\nShe lowers her eyes, holds the program close and turns toward the open entrance. She has offered a misleading account rather than completed a repair, and leaves the steward's response unprovided.\n",
